# Motion: the screen moves while something glides and does nothing once it has landed; Setup's MOTION still lands
# every move at once; the setting is the FM-1's, kept when a project loads and over a restart
wait 300
expect theme 3
expect still 0
# the autosave redraws the header when it runs, an unrelated change: off, so nothing but motion moves the screen
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row AUTOSAVE
turn ALGO -1
tap HOME
tap EDIT
settle
changes 300 0 0
turn K1 20
changes 120 2 100
settle
changes 400 0 0
# a SEL list: the pill glides to the row picked, then the screen is quiet
tap SEL
settle
turn SELECT 1
changes 100 1 100
settle
changes 400 0 0
turn SELECT -1
changes 100 1 100
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# a page change fades up and rises in (the screen changes while it does), then the screen is quiet
settle
tap FX
changes 100 6 400
settle
changes 400 0 0
# a toast: the header drops in and fades up, holds still, and fades back up when the toast ends
tap HOME
settle
tap OCT+
changes 100 2 100
wait 100
changes 200 0 0
wait 1500
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap OCT-
wait 1500
settle
# a track change crossfades the inks, then the screen is quiet
tap EDIT
settle
spin ALGO 1
changes 100 10 400
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# MOTION still: a turned knob and a picked row land at once
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row MOTION
turn ALGO 1
expect still 1
tap HOME
tap EDIT
settle
turn K1 -20
changes 100 0 1
changes 400 0 0
tap SEL
settle
turn SELECT 1
changes 100 0 1
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# ... and so are a page change, a toast and a track change
settle
tap FX
changes 100 0 0
tap HOME
settle
tap OCT+
changes 100 0 0
wait 1500
settle
tap OCT-
wait 1500
settle
tap EDIT
settle
spin ALGO 1
changes 100 0 8
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# the setting is the FM-1's: kept when project 1 loads, over a restart and by a new project
projsave 1
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 300
expect still 1
reboot
wait 400
expect still 1
projnew
expect still 1
